ake sth on trust","chinese":"轻信某事"}]},{"id":"trust:o:139b089a2955","label":"n.","definitionZh":"信托","glossesEn":["financial arrangement"],"domains":["Law"],"examples":[{"english":"to set up a trust for sb","chinese":"为某人安排信托财产"},{"english":"to hold or leave sth in trust for sb","chinese":"为某人代管某物"},{"english":"did he leave any sum in trust for his sisters?","chinese":"他有没有为他的姊妹们留下某个数量的托管财产？"}]},{"id":"trust:o:074f9ffb6caf","label":"n.","definitionZh":"受托基金机构","glossesEn":["organization"],"domains":["Law"],"examples":[{"english":"a charitable trust","chinese":"慈善基金机构"}]},{"id":"trust:o:99c94bbf2cdd","label":"n.","definitionZh":"托拉斯","registers":["dated","US"],"domains":["Business"]}]}}}